          "message": "feat(rpc_loader): Add async support for RPC function calls (#623)\n\n* feat(rpc_loader): Add async support for RPC function calls\n\n* refactor(rpc_loader): Replace std::thread with CURL multi-handle for async\n\n* refactor(rpc_loader): replace mutex with lock-free MPSC queue + curl_multi_wakeup\n\n* test(rpc): Add async RPC GTest cases: single, rapid-fire, concurrent, and mixed sync/async\n\n* refactor(rpc): remove unnecessary copies, reuse headers\n\n* test(rpc): Add async RPC GTest cases: shutdown mid-transfer, empty shutdown, error isolation",
