          "message": "Metacircular Python - load `libmetacall` via C loader from Python (#796)\n\n* expose metacall_load_from_package_ex to python\n\n* add metacircular python test using metacall_load_from_package_ex\n\n* register metacall_python_port_c_lib_metacall_test\n\n* resolve search_paths relative to config file dir\n\n* add second generated-header dir to libclang search path\n\n* use dict subscript syntax to access DictWrapper entries\n\n* handle TYPE_THROWABLE in value_to_capi\n\n* handle TYPE_EXCEPTION in value_to_capi\n\n* pass script as str, not bytes, to metacall_load_from_memory",
