          "message": "Trying to make msan work. (#804)\n\n* Trying to make msan work.\n\n* Remove CRT for MSVC gtest.\n\n* Disable shared libs for msvc.\n\n* Add debug info for CLI.\n\n* Solve issues netcore clang.\n\n* Solve issues environment.sh.\n\n* Add freeBSD to runtime.\n\n* Update netcore_linux.h\n\n* Update CMakeLists.txt\n\n* Use fetchcontent for gbench.\n\n* Improve BUILD_SHARED_LIBS.\n\n* Solve sanitizer error.\n\n* Add sanitizers preload improvement.",
